# Input routing

Pick exactly one entry per turn. Do not mix them.

## ORIENTATION

Triggers: го дальше, что дальше, продолжай, поднимем голову, go next,
continue, what next, next best step — when the ask is project direction or
the next meaningful step.

Read-only Git truth only: last verified result, due time gates, any still-live
exact contract, the named product/evidence gap. Challenge the current route
when evidence warrants it. Never search latest/newest/current work. No
mutation, provider/API/RPC/WSS, credentials or new write set.

Return one verdict and one next atom:
`CONTINUE | REPLAN | SELECT | STRATEGY | BOTTLENECK | RESEARCH | OWNER_DECISION`.

If an unfinished exact contract has a safe in-scope next step, return
`CONTINUE` and follow EXECUTE. Otherwise stop before mutation. A new write
set needs an exact task contract plus one owner OK. Do not invent a task to
dodge `OWNER_DECISION`.

## EXECUTE

Triggers: a named TASK/CTRL contract, `/delivery-start`, or resume of that
already-bound contract.

Use `.agents/skills/delivery-harness/SKILL.md`. Run
`scripts/delivery_harness.py check` then `context`. Preserve explicit gaps
and route continuity. Open one repository/worktree root only.

## NEITHER

Isolated explanation, Plan/Ask, one-file debug or translation: answer in
place. Do not open the skill or run orientation.
